    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6966" root="حبل" body-key="H">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احبل العِضَاهُ</span></b>  <i>The</i> [<i>trees called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عضاه</span> [<i>produced their</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبْل</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُبَل</span>; or] <i>scattered their
blossoms, and organized and compacted their
fruit</i> [i. e. <i>their pods with the seeds therein</i>];
expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَاثَرَ وَرْدُهَا وَ عَقَدَ</span> [meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَقَدَ الثَّمَرَ</span>]:
(A, O, K:) from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحُبْلَةُ</span> [q. v.], like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَّفَ</span> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العُلَّفَ</span>. (AA, O, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احبلهُ</span>, (S, K,) inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِحْبَالٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He fecundated it;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَلْقَحَهُ</span>.
(S, K.)

